<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>工作提交 · AIPC</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/aipc.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/aipc-shell.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/submissions.css?v=3"></head>
<body data-submission-kind="code"><aside class="sidebar" id="aipc-sidebar"></aside><script src="/aipc-shell.js"></script><div class="workspace"><main class="submissions-page">
<header class="sub-heading"><div><span class="sub-eyebrow">TEAM WORKSPACE</span><h1>工作提交</h1><p>归档每一次交付，让说明与源码始终在一起。</p></div><button class="sub-button primary" id="new-submission" disabled><i data-icon="Plus"></i>新建提交</button></header>
<nav class="sub-tabs" aria-label="提交类型"><a href="/submissions.html" class="selected" aria-current="page"><i data-icon="Package"></i>代码交付</a><a href="/submission-videos.html"><i data-icon="Film"></i>视频版本</a></nav>
<p class="sub-message" id="page-message" role="status" hidden></p>
<section id="submission-login" class="sub-auth" hidden><div class="sub-empty-icon"><i data-icon="LockKeyhole"></i></div><h2>登录后查看团队提交</h2><p>使用 AIPC 管理账户查看版本、上传交付和下载源码。</p><button class="sub-button primary" id="submission-sign-in">登录 AIPC</button></section>
<section id="submission-loading" class="sub-loading" aria-live="polite"><span class="sub-spinner"></span>正在整理工作区…</section>
<div id="submission-content" hidden><section class="sub-areas" id="submission-areas" aria-label="开发区域"></section><div class="sub-projects" id="aipc-projects" hidden><div><span class="sub-caption">AIPC 子项</span><div id="project-options" class="sub-project-options"></div></div><button class="sub-button" id="add-project"><i data-icon="FolderPlus"></i>添加子项</button></div>
<section class="sub-queue"><div class="sub-queue-heading"><div><span class="sub-eyebrow" id="queue-area"></span><h2 id="queue-title"></h2><p id="queue-summary"></p></div><a class="sub-button" id="latest-download" aria-disabled="true"><i data-icon="Download"></i><span>下载最新完整包</span></a></div><div id="submission-list" class="sub-timeline" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="sub-history"><button class="sub-button" id="expand-history" hidden></button><button class="sub-text-button" id="collapse-history" hidden>收起，仅看最新三条</button></div></section></div>
</main></div>
<dialog class="sub-dialog" id="submit-dialog" aria-labelledby="submit-title"><form id="submission-form"><div class="sub-dialog-heading"><div><span class="sub-eyebrow">NEW DELIVERY</span><h2 id="submit-title">新建提交</h2><p id="submit-queue-label"></p></div><button type="button" class="sub-icon-button" data-close aria-label="关闭提交窗口"><i data-icon="X"></i></button></div><div class="sub-form-grid"><label class="sub-field full">提交标题<input name="title" maxlength="120" required placeholder="本次完成了什么"></label><label class="sub-field">版本号 <small>可选</small><input name="version" maxlength="60" placeholder="如 v1.0.0"></label><label class="sub-field">提交人<input name="author" maxlength="60" required placeholder="姓名或团队"></label></div><div id="submission-file-fields"></div><label class="sub-field sub-note" id="note-field">补充说明 <small>可选，支持 Markdown</small><textarea name="note" maxlength="8000" rows="3" placeholder="本次视频演示的内容、注意事项…"></textarea></label><p id="submit-error" class="sub-message error" role="alert" hidden></p><div id="upload-progress-panel" hidden><div class="sub-progress-label"><span id="upload-stage">准备上传</span><strong id="upload-percent">0%</strong></div><progress id="upload-progress" max="100" value="0"></progress><p class="sub-muted">文件全部上传并校验完成后才会出现在版本列表中。</p></div><footer class="sub-form-footer"><span id="submission-requirements">每次提交必须包含 MD 说明与 ZIP 源码。</span><button type="button" class="sub-button" data-close>取消</button><button class="sub-button primary" id="publish-submission" type="submit"><i data-icon="Upload"></i>上传并发布</button></footer></form></dialog>
<dialog class="sub-dialog sub-project-dialog" id="project-dialog" aria-labelledby="project-title"><form id="project-form"><div class="sub-dialog-heading"><div><span class="sub-eyebrow">AIPC WORKSPACE</span><h2 id="project-title">添加 AIPC 子项</h2></div><button type="button" class="sub-icon-button" data-close aria-label="关闭"><i data-icon="X"></i></button></div><label class="sub-field">子项名称<input name="name" maxlength="48" required placeholder="如：机械臂控制、视觉感知、语音交互"></label><p class="sub-muted">新子项拥有独立的代码与视频提交队列。</p><p class="sub-message error" id="project-error" role="alert" hidden></p><footer class="sub-form-footer"><button class="sub-button" type="button" data-close>取消</button><button class="sub-button primary">创建子项</button></footer></form></dialog>
<dialog class="sub-dialog sub-notes-dialog" id="notes-dialog" aria-labelledby="notes-title"><div class="sub-dialog-heading"><div><span class="sub-eyebrow">RELEASE NOTES</span><h2 id="notes-title">提交说明</h2></div><button type="button" class="sub-icon-button" data-close aria-label="关闭说明"><i data-icon="X"></i></button></div><article id="submission-notes" class="sub-markdown"></article></dialog>
<dialog class="sub-dialog sub-video-dialog" id="video-dialog" aria-labelledby="video-title"><div class="sub-dialog-heading"><div><span class="sub-eyebrow">VIDEO PREVIEW</span><h2 id="video-title"></h2><p id="video-meta"></p></div><button type="button" class="sub-icon-button" data-close aria-label="关闭视频"><i data-icon="X"></i></button></div><video id="submission-video" controls playsinline preload="metadata"></video><p class="sub-message error" id="video-error" hidden>当前浏览器无法播放该视频编码，请下载原片后查看。</p><a class="sub-button" id="video-download"><i data-icon="Download"></i>下载原片</a></dialog>
<script src="/vendor/lucide.js"></script><script src="/vendor/marked.js"></script><script src="/vendor/purify.js"></script><script src="/submissions.js?v=3"></script></body></html>
